  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable ethno-cultural economic initiatives for 11 communities in Suchitoto, El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RAIS will offer training and technical assistance that enables residents from 11 communities in Suchitoto to revitalize and market traditional crafts and to engage in cultural tourism. The project is expected to improve the skills, earnings and cultural pride of 800 Salvadorans.</narrative>
  </description>
